<title>USA: Service 1996 acquisitions add revenue.</title>
<headline>Service 1996 acquisitions add revenue.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Service Corp International said Thursday the acquisitions that it had made last year would produce about $180 million in annualized revenues.</p>
<p>The funeral and cemetery company said it had acquired 210 funeral service locations, 35 cemeteries and nine crematoria in 1996 for a combined total of about $363 million.</p>
<p>&quot;Very significant growth opportunities exist for SCI (the company), both domestically and internationally,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>&quot;SCI will continue to execute its proven strategy of solid internal growth and growth by acquisitions that add value for our shareholders.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
